{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b9dd903b-c679-8f9d-9904-62549d78b9a4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T10:20:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diane Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:18:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Merry Christmas Eve, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about trash. Um, I own a house and my tenant just moved out, and the landlord, well, the previous landlord of the other unit, left a pile of stuff on the curb. A mattress, a couple of chairs, boxes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:18:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So that's bulk waste sitting out after a move-out. Is it sitting on the curb in front of your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:18:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. In front of my house. But I didn't put it there. How do I know I won't get ticketed for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:18:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Bulk items usually need to be scheduled or tagged for pickup, they can't just sit out. If you call it in, it's on record that you're addressing it. I can note that you didn't put it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:18:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, and you're noting that now? Like it's actually written down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:18:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm typing it in as we speak. Do you have a street address for the pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:19:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I'd rather not say it on speakerphone. Can I just ask when the next pickup is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:19:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Without the address I can't say your exact route. Regular trash goes by your street's day, and the holiday can shift it by a day. Do you know your normal trash day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:19:21-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. Usually Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:19:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then with Christmas tomorrow, I'd expect it to slide, probably to Friday this week. Check the city's holiday schedule online to confirm, since I can't see your route from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:19:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, so Friday, not Thursday. And that's for the regular trash, not the mattress."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:19:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. The mattress and chairs are bulk, so they'd be a separate pickup. Call back with the address and we'll get it set up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:19:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long does that usually take? Why can't they just grab it Friday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:19:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Different crew and a different truck, so it's often a separate day. I can't promise it's Friday. It's a holiday week too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, there's a lot of noise, I'm in the car. The school sent home a supply list and it's like glue sticks by the dozen, so I'm heading to the store."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:20:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a lot of glue. Well, go get them. When you call back, just have your address handy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:20:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So Friday for regular trash, and call back for the bulk. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:20:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T10:20:18-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
